«
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  BetaCDFc
  @  Upper tail at X.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "BetaCDFc: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → av bv Xv « av 0 + bv 0 + Xv 0 + → a b X « '1-(IFTE(X≤0;0;IFTE(X≥1;1;BetaI(a;b;X))))' →Num av bv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
»
